config BR2_PACKAGE_ROCKNIX_JOYPAD
	bool "rocknix-joypad"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  ROCKNIX's joypad driver: the H700 handhelds' buttons (GPIO)
	  and stick (the ADC behind an analog mux) as one input device.
	  ROCKNIX's device trees for these units name it (patch 0140).

	  https://github.com/ROCKNIX/rocknix-joypad
